Files: src/dhcpig/data/satori_dhcp_fingerprints.json
Copyright: 2004-2026 Eric Kollmann and the Satori contributors
License: GPL-2+
Comment: A static, offline DHCP fingerprint lookup table (option 55 parameter
 request lists, and option 60 vendor class identifiers), generated from the
 Satori project's fingerprints/dhcp.xml by the converter bundled beside it,
 src/dhcpig/data/satori-merge.py. It is queried by an exact dictionary lookup;
 no network service or API key is involved. Satori is at
 https://github.com/xnih/satori and is GPL-2.0 licensed.
 .
 Upstream releases before 2.7.0 instead bundled a table derived from PacketFence
 and Fingerbank (Inverse inc.), which is ODbL-1.0 / DbCL-1.0 rather than GPL.
 It was replaced so the whole source package is under a single license; nothing
 derived from it remains.

